__id__ = "ai_autoreply"
__name__ = "AI auto-reply"
__description__ = "Answers incoming messages with the app's AI in chats you add (or in every private chat with 'answer everyone'), in your own writing style (learns from your sent messages, splits and delays replies). Auto, draft or .ai command mode; typing .ai yourself makes the bot write first. Presets (Live human-like by default, Balanced, Chatty, Quiet): a periodic safety-net scan of the chats, human reply timing with a typing indicator, read marks, occasional stickers, fewer blocking rules, decision log."
